            "description": "Retrieves one API record for this request:\n\n[<code>https://api.getpostman.com/api/{{apiToValidate}}</code>](https://api.getpostman.com/workspaces)\n\nPopulate `apiToValidate` to verify that a mapped API exists and that its details match the collected dataset. Use it for spot checks when validating output quality.\n\nOr\n\nRetrieve the related workspace information tied to an element:\n\n[<code>https://api.getpostman.com/workspaces?elementType=api&amp;elementId={{elementId}}</code>](https://api.getpostman.com/workspaces?elementType=api&elementId=%7B%7BelementId%7D%7D)\n\n`elementId` will be the ID of your API ior Collection. Use it for spot checks when validating output quality."
